<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 25.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 25.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.76 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.01 vs   4.71</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.73 vs   3.52</p>
<p> Sales		  160.07 vs 111.46</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    25.42 vs   45.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	42.71 vs   73.40</p>
<p> Operating profit    35.81 vs   33.85</p>
<p> Sales		1,633.32 vs1,882.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
